{"seq":19,"slug":"supply-chain-management","title":"供应链管理","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 供应链管理\n\n供应链管理（Supply Chain Management, SCM）覆盖从原材料采购到终端交付的全链路协调与优化。2026 年，地缘政治波动、AI 技术爆发、ESG 合规趋严三股力量叠加，供应链正从\"成本驱动\"范式转向\"价值驱动 + 韧性优先\"范式。本 hub 聚焦于供应链的体系设计、计划执行、技术赋能与战略决策四个维度，帮助开发者理解如何用系统工程思维构建和优化现代供应链。\n\n## 本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n本 hub 关注供应链管理的**体系性框架**——从需求计划、采购、库存到全局战略决策，属于\"链主/供应链部门\"视角。与之区别：\n\n- [电商物流](../15_ecommerce-logistics/_INTRODUCTION.md)侧重仓储、配送、末端履约等物流执行层，是供应链的物理搬运环节。\n- [电商运营](../04_ecommerce-operations/_INTRODUCTION.md)侧重店铺经营、订单流转、促销策略，是供应链下游的需求触发端。\n- [跨境电商](../18_cross-border-ecommerce/_INTRODUCTION.md)聚焦跨国场景下的合规、清关、海外仓，是供应链在全球化语境中的特殊形态。\n\n本 hub 提供的是贯穿上下游的\"指挥中枢\"视角：如何做计划、选供应商、配库存、定源策略、建控制塔、评估韧性。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n对于有 3-7 年经验的开发者，建议按以下顺序阅读：\n\n1. **基础篇**（foundations）——先建立供应链架构的心智模型，理解需求计划和采购的核心逻辑。\n2. **物流篇**（logistics）——从库存管理、仓网设计到运输调度，掌握供应链物理执行层的关键决策。\n3. **技术篇**（technology）——了解 AI、数字孪生、控制塔等 2026 年前沿工具如何改变供应链运作方式。\n4. **战略篇**（strategy）——从近岸外包、韧性设计到 ESG 合规，把视野拉到供应链的全局战略层。\n\n如果对某一模块有明确需求（如正在做供应链系统的技术选型），可以直接进入技术篇。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基本的业务流程概念（订单、库存、采购）\n- 了解电商业务的基本运作模式（可先阅读电商运营 hub）\n- 对分布式系统有初步认识（有助于理解供应链信息系统）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"供应链基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-chain-architecture","title":"供应链网络架构与参考模型","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/supply-chain-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-planning-forecasting","title":"需求计划与预测方法","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/demand-planning-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"procurement-supplier-management","title":"采购与供应商管理","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/procurement-supplier-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics","title":"供应链物流管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-management-optimization","title":"库存管理与优化策略","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/inventory-management-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-distribution-network","title":"仓配网络与分销设计","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/warehouse-distribution-network"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transportation-freight-management","title":"运输与货运管理","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/transportation-freight-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology","title":"供应链技术赋能","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-driven-supply-chain","title":"AI 驱动的智能供应链","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology/ai-driven-supply-chain"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-twin-simulation","title":"数字孪生与供应链仿真","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology/digital-twin-simulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-visibility-platform","title":"供应链可视化控制塔","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology/supply-chain-visibility-platform"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy","title":"供应链战略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nearshoring-sourcing-strategy","title":"近岸外包与全球源策略","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/nearshoring-sourcing-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-resilience","title":"供应链韧性与风险管理","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/supply-chain-resilience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"esg-sustainable-supply-chain","title":"ESG 与可持续供应链","url":"/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/esg-sustainable-supply-chain"}]}]}